          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Custom Oil and Gas Equipment Manufacturing Solutions",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Gas operations require machinery and process equipment that can handle extreme conditions and continuous use. We manufacture high quality oilfield equipment and related equipment that supports the extraction, production, and transportation of natural gas and crude oil. Whether you're expanding a gas project or replacing aging production equipment, we build with durability and efficiency in mind. Some of our key offerings include:</p><ul><li><strong>Custom Engineered Machines:</strong> We collaborate with our clients to design and construct equipment that meets their unique operational requirements.</li><li><strong>Tool Improvements:</strong> Our team excels in upgrading existing tools to enhance functionality, reliability, and safety in the field.</li><li><strong>Durable Components: </strong>Built to last, our components are crafted using high-quality materials and cutting-edge manufacturing techniques.</li></ul>",
            "desktop_content_position": "center-md",
            "desktop_content_alignment": "ta-left-md top-md",
            "desktop_column": "4",
            "desktop_row": "2",
