            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>At EZG Manufacturing we take pride in our superior <a href=\"https://ezgmfg.com/capabilities-2/welding/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">welding capabilities</span></a>, which play a role in durable, high-performance custom oil and gas equipment manufacturing. Our in-house team of certified welders specializes in various welding techniques, including MIG, TIG, stick, robotic, and pulse welding, to deliver components that withstand harsh environmental conditions and heavy workloads. These welding services ensure every piece of high performance equipment meets the industry’s toughest standards for durability and precision.</p>",
